# Five qubits: data d0,d1,d2 and parity ancillas a0,a1.
# A middle-data X fault is injected deterministically for the baseline.
R 0 1 2 3 4
X_ERROR(0.001) 0 1 2
X 1
# Noisy parity extraction.
CX 0 3
CX 1 3
CX 1 4
CX 2 4
X_ERROR(0.001) 3 4
M 3 4
DETECTOR(0, 0) rec[-2]
DETECTOR(1, 0) rec[-1]
